{
  "description": "D-176: the guard-fight scene - slippers on, HUB 1 25 m ahead, a farming troll (tag `troll`) 16 m ahead-left, and 2 s later a creature (tag `mob`, default Greydwarf) at `mobDx`,`mobDz` that goes for the player. Call guardFight next.",
